ucial role in spearheading the assault during <strong>Operation Market Garden</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead a tank </strong>in a climactic mission<strong> </strong>that offers a<strong> change of pace </strong>from infantry combat.<strong> </strong>Experience the battlefield from the<strong> perspective of a tank commander - </strong>sharpen your senses to survive <strong>intense armored battles</strong> in challenging conditions and unforgiving swamps and lowlands of the Dutch countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/4637279960dd5b5edee7d0404c3aea82.poster.avif?t=1768938826\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/4637279960dd5b5edee7d0404c3aea82.webm?t=1768938826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/4637279960dd5b5edee7d0404c3aea82.mp4?t=1768938826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/b835bc5725dc9444ff6af7fa2fba13ca.avif?t=1768938826\" width=760 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🟨  STYLIZED GRAPHICS - TRIBUTE TO LONG GONE ERA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a <strong>love letter to the PlayStation 2 era - golden era of WWII games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unforgettable WWII games that shaped a generation of players, delivering gripping stories, intense battles, and immersive campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was a time when war stories were told with<strong> heart, authenticity, passion, and deep respect for history -  <u>and we are on the mission to bring this back.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>stylized visuals</strong> designed to capture the <strong>warmth and charm of that time</strong>, we blend <strong>nostalgia</strong> with <strong>refined gameplay</strong> to <strong>bring back the magic of a long gone era</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn’t just a game. It’s a tribute.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/eb4ec19303166c93d63acd85c0fdebde.poster.avif?t=1768938826\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/eb4ec19303166c93d63acd85c0fdebde.webm?t=1768938826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/eb4ec19303166c93d63acd85c0fdebde.mp4?t=1768938826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/e50c1affa04640bd327925191475fda9.avif?t=1768938826\" width=760 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🟨  WELCOME TO ARNHEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the blood-soaked streets of <strong>Arnhem</strong> and relive one of the most intense battles of <strong>World War II</strong>. The <strong>city has been faithfully recreated</strong> to capture the atmosphere and chaos of this historic battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/6e9fe724ada56396249deddd7ac64c43.poster.avif?t=1768938826\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/6e9fe724ada56396249deddd7ac64c43.webm?t=1768938826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/6e9fe724ada56396249deddd7ac64c43.mp4?t=1768938826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🟨 AND MANY MORE ....</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From war-torn cities to the vast countryside of the Netherlands, we bring iconic locations to life with authenticity and respect. Inspired by both real history and the unforgettable depictions in classic war films, every environment immerses you in the <strong>authentic atmosphere of World War II.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/765c1420bb7ec4a871da5f718e1b1a49.avif?t=1768938826\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras_big/765c1420bb7ec4a871da5f718e1b1a49.avif?t=1768938826 width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/b4c88de9f56737859c4c290501014553.webp?t=1768938826\" width=766 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/0d81331d3e5163b0f02808b932a42bbc.poster.avif?t=1768938826\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/0d81331d3e5163b0f02808b932a42bbc.webm?t=1768938826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/extras/0d81331d3e5163b0f02808b932a42bbc.mp4?t=1768938826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "MARKET GARDEN lets you relive the golden era of WW2 shooters, bringing classic, old-school FPS action back to its roots. Experience the epic airborne operation MARKET GARDEN in a game that pays tribute both to the genre’s finest moments and the real historical events.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Dutch, Hungarian, Polish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/92dbfc6a8a0f7f059df86f157c637d6b8713b7a5/header.jpg?t=1768938826", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/ff37bc83b7cb5f738e0d36b2d691126b340a6ad9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768938826", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471890/ff37bc83b7cb5f738e0d36b2d691126b340a6ad9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768938826", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 5500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 10 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GT